{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-a50dbc59445c4d6346811e7d7e1d93d4162a8b76 \"Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook.\"]].\n\nThe handbook's parking rule specifies that certain parking spaces are reserved and that there is a time limit for parking. Specifically, spaces numbered twelve through thirty are reserved, and the time limit for parking in these spaces is two hours [[cite:obs-a50dbc59445c4d6346811e7d7e1d93d4162a8b76 \"Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook.\"]].","expected_sha256":"26a886aec5ac31c9e50b9cf21c7f44a1b655ddc7fb62ff3952cfa2239dc69404","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the handbook's parking rule including reserved spaces and time limit with exact citation from the handbook source as required."}